<GscMonitorLayout title="Terms of use" description="Conditions and limitations for private, authorized use of Rushdan Indexing Monitor." canonicalPath="/tools/gsc-monitor/terms/" page="terms">
  <p><strong>Last updated: 8 October 2026.</strong> Rushdan Indexing Monitor is operated by Rushdan Rosdi for internal and expressly authorized private use. The engine is prepared for deployment; no public registration or paid service is offered through these pages.</p>
  <h2>Authorized use</h2>
  <p>Only connect or monitor properties you own or have permission to access. Use reports within that authorization and protect any administrative credentials supplied to you. Google Search Console data is used only for authorized indexing monitoring and reporting, as described in the <a href="/tools/gsc-monitor/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Read-only monitoring</h2>
  <p>The tool reads Search Console data and checks public website signals. It does not change Search Console settings, publish website changes or automate Request Indexing. Any recommended action requires human review and, where applicable, separate permission from the property owner.</p>
  <h2>Dependencies and limitations</h2>
  <p>Operation depends on Google APIs, Cloudflare services, valid OAuth credentials, property permissions and the monitored website. Quotas, outages, permission changes and API changes may interrupt or delay monitoring. Multi-property use requires separate configuration and authorization.</p>
  <p>URL Inspection reports Google's stored index information, not a live URL test. Public technical checks are bounded and do not render JavaScript. Missing data, failed requests or incomplete sitemap discovery can limit reports; independent checks do not establish Google's indexing decisions.</p>
  <p>No indexing, ranking, traffic, completeness or uninterrupted-availability result is guaranteed. Reports are diagnostic information and should be verified before consequential decisions. The tool is provided as available, subject to applicable law.</p>
  <h2>Stopping use and changes</h2>
  <p>You may revoke Google access at any time. For disabling monitoring or deleting stored records, follow the <a href="/tools/gsc-monitor/privacy/">privacy policy</a> and contact the operator. Access may be suspended if authorization is withdrawn, credentials are compromised or use falls outside the agreed purpose.</p>
  <p>These terms may be updated as the private tool changes. Google API access remains subject to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms">Google APIs Terms of Service</a> and <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>. This independent application is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.</p>
</GscMonitorLayout>
